                "text": "Vaultwarden HTML injection vulnerability"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An HTML injection vulnerability in Vaultwarden prior to v1.32.5 allows attackers to execute arbitrary code via injecting a crafted payload into the username field of an e-mail message."
